บ audio is the master clock; every frame is a pure function of time t        บ
บ per-frame band energies + kick/snare/hat envelopes baked into assets/      บ
บ scenes: synthwave world w/ 3D palms, KIFS glass, hyperspace, matrix rain,  บ
บ         EQ rings, feedback trails, kaleidoscope, shatter                   บ
บ pass 2: whole-frame ASCII re-render, kick shockwave rings, melt/drip       บ
บ post  : bloom, VHS, simplex line-glitch, chroma aberration, FOV stretch    บ
บ type  : brutalist layer -> invert mask + knock-out window on drum hits     บ
บ canvas: 1920-unit virtual canvas, one code path for every aspect ratio     บ
บ stack : Python . pygame (SDL2) . moderngl . numpy . PyInstaller            บ
