บ linux : sudo apt install python3-venv libsdl2-2.0-0 ffmpeg   (or your      บ
บ         distro's equivalent). Wayland trouble? SDL_VIDEODRIVER=x11         บ
บ mac   : brew install python ffmpeg. macOS only offers GL 3.3 as a          บ
บ         forward-compatible core context, so if context creation fails,     บ
บ         start with the gl_set_attribute calls in r00t/player.py            บ
บ fonts : the type engine loads Windows fonts (Bahnschrift, Consolas...)     บ
บ         and falls back to a plain default. It should still run, but the    บ
บ         lettering will not look like the video. Point kt_core.py and       บ
บ         typo.py (in r00t/) at any bold condensed / mono .ttf.              บ
